けますと、使用する際の自由度が高まりますのでお願いできますと幸いです…！  \n\n以下のURLを服装、容姿の参考資料としてお使いいただけますと幸いです。  \n\n参考資料1 \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TDd_mhBaJD1ZwYrNehES-p6TqS0xPiq4 \n\n参考資料2 \nhttps://twitter.com/kaname_karupis/status/1637803599811219458?s=46&t=jcifdrt2qc8KAVdqpqgZGg  \n \nご検討、よろしくお願い致します。", "nc": 153, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 13987, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ブラニン", "screen_name": "buraninn", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1381521033379733504/EzJcJtjq.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/525039013/1732346355/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 185153, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "みくりうに⁂", "screen_name": "mikuriuni", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2023878057430573056/p8hTUB_d.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/88830459/1707952546/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 15, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 129}, {"id": 478275, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ヲム", "screen_name": "wo1059mu", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2006351917174472704/FjYFKJEc.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1108604701287735296/1632407011/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": nu